<h2 id="preface">Preface</h2>

<p>Having seen countless times how people always create files using a <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">timestamp + arc4random()</code>, I felt deeply frustrated. Doesn’t the operating system provide a relevant function? So I found the following code to deal with filename conflicts when creating files.</p>

