<p><em><strong>Remember that the file suffix needs to include <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">XXXXXX</code></strong></em> — each <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">X</code> represents one character of <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">digits + letters</code>
<em>Note</em>: It’s best to use 6 X’s or more. <a href="http://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man3/mkstemp.3.html">See Linux reference</a></p>

